STEP 1 — UNDERSTAND THE TEMPLATE STRUCTURE:

Read the [STRUCTURAL HINTS FROM DOCX ANALYSIS] block embedded above.
It contains:
- Layout Style: table_based | freeflow | mixed
- Table Loops Detected: mail-merge loops with loop_variable and item_fields
- Paste Zone Headings: headings indicating large CV paste areas
